.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK REPORT EDIT"
.SH NAME
hamstik report edit \- Replace an Advanced Report from a complete JSON definition
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik report edit [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Replace an Advanced Report from a complete JSON definition
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ID
Advanced Report UUID
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --file
JSON file containing an AdvancedReportInput (`-` for stdin)
.TP
.B --force
Bypass optimistic-concurrency protection (`If-Match: *`)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
